word?token=abc123" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:8px;background-color:#b94e3a;color:#ffffff;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Activate your account</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:24px;color:#999999;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:16px">If you weren&#x27;t expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email — your account stays inactive until the link is used. The link expires after a short period.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

